Cross-section annotations of DamSegment crack walls, by the vision-metrology contributors.

The files in this folder are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

They hold station positions and wall offsets only, no image data. The stations were
derived from the crack masks of DamSegment, which its authors release under CC BY 4.0
(https://doi.org/10.17632/z5z6gtt5t4.1). When you use these annotations, cite this
repository and the source dataset:

  V. Gharehbaghi, C. R. Bennett, R. Lequesne, H. Zhao and J. Li, DamSegment, Mendeley
  Data, V1, 2025, doi:10.17632/z5z6gtt5t4.1.

The images themselves are not distributed here; fetch them with
`python3 tools/datasets/fetch.py damsegment`.
